  "description": "The Audio brings BMX into a larger 22” wheel format, creating a more stable and composed ride while maintaining the familiar BMX look and feel. Designed for committed trail riders and taller riders wanting a better proportioned setup, it keeps things true to BMX without compromise. At its core is a full chromoly aftermarket frame, paired with a reinforced fork featuring an overbuilt steerer and crown designed for heavy riding. The geometry was carefully developed from the ground up, alongside dedicated 22” components like the Logic rim and Overbite tyre. A bike that rides better than it looks on paper, the Audio is helping lead the 22” evolution.",
